      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MILLWOOD MIKI (2) finished second at Bathurst two runs ago then settled back and failed to figure at his latest appearance over 1730m at Bathurst, beaten 24 metres into eighth. Has the benefit of a good draw. Tackles a similar assignment and he can finish a lot closer this time. KARINYA SOPHIE (10) missed the placings two runs back then did a great job to finish 12 metres back in third despite breaking in the run over 2040m at Parkes five days ago. Not drawn to best so may need a 10/10 drive. Meets a similar line up so she must be respected. WAT ON EARTH (11) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when she finished third at Canberra over 1770m. GOOD TALK (4) could only finish seventh over 1770m at Canberra most recently. Open to improvement and is in the mix.",
